# nix build output symlinks
result
result-*

# NOTE: everything else here is intentionally tracked, including:
#   pkgs/cheatengine-x86_64.exe   6.9 MB vendored Windows binary (not fetchable)
#   themes/                        3.3 MB vendored Carl suite (pling is unautomatable)
#   vendor/quadcast2s/             376 KB vendored project source
# The flake copies only files TRACKED BY GIT into the store, so anything you
# leave untracked will be missing at build time.

# editor / OS cruft
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
